{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Dismiss us, [F]Lord, [C]with [G]blessing, [C]we [G7]pray;
[G7]As from Thy worship [C]we go [B7]our [C]ways;
[C]Guide in life’s con[C7]flicts, [F]all through [G7]the [F]day;
[F]Save in Thy [C]ki[G7]ng[C]dom, Thine [G7]be the [C]praise.
[F]A[C]men.
{end_of_verse}
